      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEO DEVERE (5) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (28.33) at Bendigo in a Grade 4/5. Looks suited here and big improvement expected. INDIAN PRINCE (4) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (25.29) at Shepparton the start prior. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Should be in this for a long way. PAR EXCELLENCE (1) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some good form but finished second (30.49) at this track. Ready to find winning form. PAW CORNELIUS (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished third (29.93), beaten 5.5 lengths. Deserves a win and gets his chance.",
